# counter harness. One force call is one ext_pot evaluation of the r2549 Aluminum EAM.
# A window's calls are its share of the server total, split by sad-fcs inside each pass.
# The dimer block is CG, rotations_max 50, converged_angle 1. Other options stay at the constructor.
# barrier windows closed: 0. Archive averages used 639 barrier windows and 20 rate windows.
# No reference window closed. force_calls is the mean harness cost of the finished searches, not a window mean.
# Stock dimer CG on the Al reactant. The dimer block is the published algorithm, CG with 50 rotations and angle 1. Confidence, displacement, prefactor, and the optimizer iteration limit stay at the r2549 constructor. The kernel is the Fortran Aluminum EAM through ext_pot. Window closure uses the 2014 report rule and is not an optimizer setting. Stock confidence does not stop a reactant that has not collected the reference processes, so the run is 64 AKMC passes unless both window targets close first. That bound is the observation, not an optimizer parameter.
